WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:15.220
<! Chapter PEMBUKA !>

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:03.650
Aizen Myouou Hotaru

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:09.090
Literal name of the Buddhist God of Love, that also known as Ragaraja.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.090
Oh, Aizen Myouou-sama.

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:04.080
Aizen Myouou Hotaru

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.320
Why would...

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.090
Hotaru-san do something like this?

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.860
You sure fooled us, yes?

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:19.970
The one using the love potion to control men is you, yes?

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:23.840
Do you know, what kind of place Yoshiwara is?

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:29.780
It is a place where you have to like men you may not like at all.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:34.280
In this place, I fell in love with lots of different men,

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:39.520
that I began to lose track of whom I really liked.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.220
What's so bad about this love drug?

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.490
Don't you think that it's a much more beautiful form of love...

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:49.360
than the kind in people's hearts that just fade away with the passage of time?

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.630
Let's come to the love...

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:54.300
you will never awaken from.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.300
To true love.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.110
Sorry.

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:03.310
I never going back to bed with someone, even with a woman.

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:06.310
If you want to dream, do it on your own, Honey.

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:10.720
I'm tired of smelling that sickly sweet smell.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:15.190
It's about time for you to wake-up, Hotaru.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:35.740
Even living shrewdly,

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:35.940
zuruku ikiru yarikata mo

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:39.280
without emotion it's simply vulgar

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:38.680
jouchounashi ja gehin daro

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.650
Even being intoxicated with your useless side

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:41.950
damena jibun ni you no mo

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:45.220
is a spice in the recipe of being loved

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.920
aisareru tame no SUPAISU sa

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:47.490
If you feel like running away,

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.890
nigedashitaku nattara

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:50.760
maybe you should do it every once in a while

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:50.320
tama ni wa nigedaseba ii

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:53.430
Diver yourself from the rails

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:53.760
dareka ni kitai sareteta

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:57.000
that someone else expected you to follow

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.130
REERU kara mo

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.760
hazurete ike

00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:59.830
So One! Two!Wow!

00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:59.830
Wow!

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:02.630
Three! Four!Wow!

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:02.630
Wow!

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:04.270
Then even

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.770
itsumo doori no

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:04.800
Hey!

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:05.670
that same old sunset

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.110
yuuhi de sae

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:08.640
will look so beautiful

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:06.240
Hey!

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:08.970
kirei ni mieru ze

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:09.840
So Jump!

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:49.620
The secret love potion that hidden
by Yoshiwara, Aizen Kou

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:49.620
Everyone got smoked and captivated
by Aizen Myouou Hotaru!?

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:55.290
But, behind the ruckus that was caused
by this plan...

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:55.290
can it make Gintoki and Tsukuyo blooming their smile?

00:02:55.290 --> 00:03:01.290
Eternal Flower

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:02.290
Gin-san!

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:03.300
Tsukki!

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.800
Tsukuyo-chan? How?

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.900
You should be captured by my followers.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:09.100
Followers?

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.700
Oh, what a confidence you've got.

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:15.140
Protect Myouou-sama from the traitors!

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:21.980
What are you acting so goofy for?!

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.550
Aizen Myouou-sama this and that.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:25.080
I-I thought you used to be my stalker?

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:28.690
You idiot!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.860
Ahh, I feel queasy.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:34.130
Why do I feel so queasy?

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:35.190
Could it be...

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:36.560
It can't be...

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.730
She's fallen for...

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.400
Him?!

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:43.170
Uhh~ I'm getting nervous!

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:45.370
Now the positions are totally reversed from normal!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.270
The Gorilla's become the Gorillla's stalker now!

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:50.010
Then not all that much has changed, yes?

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:52.910
Why the hell are you joining in?!

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:55.780
Could it be, there are still outsiders...

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:57.680
Here as well.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:03.420
Sorry, but there are some people in this world that even your wiles won't reach.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:08.690
However, thanks to you, I was able to escape the bonds of my unrequited love.

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:12.900
And now, I can move forward looking only at this one sword.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.370
Oh, is that right?

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:17.170
So you finally feel like facing men now, huh?

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:21.270
Okay, this time, it should be one long sword, but I'll show you two or three spurts of long sword.

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.540
No, one is fine.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.180
A-As long as I can have that thing.

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:27.050
That's the one you wanted?!

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:29.250
Heeey!

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:32.120
What situation were you guys in when you smelled the love drug?!

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:35.090
And why the hell Tsukuyo-san is joining in too?!

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:39.120
I've realized.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:44.930
Every time I saw that person's face as he kept following me around, I'll do horrible things to him.

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:49.230
But when he stopped appearing, I realized.

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:52.810
This feeling isn't disgust.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.440
Because the stalker...

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.740
was me after all.

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.310
Kondou-san~!

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:02.550
Why are you flirting with another woman?!

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:06.550
Did you forget that you're a gorilla stuck in a cage that's monitored 24 hours a day?!

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:07.820
Oh my gosh!

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.820
My sister turned into a fiendish stalker!

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:12.260
Hwelp mwe, pweease, Ayizen Myouou-swama!

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:14.790
It's cwoming off! It's cwoming owfff!!

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.800
What a lunatic girl!

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:18.530
This place is dangerous.
Hurry up, move!

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:21.600
Wh-What?!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.100
I've realized.

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:30.780
Up until now, I have embraced feelings much like love towards Tae-chan's dignified appearance.

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:32.340
But now I've realized.

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:37.180
What I was seeing was not her, but the dignified thing...

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:39.490
that growing between her legs.

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:41.290
The hell is growing on my sister?!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:44.490
With those things between the legs, anyone's will do.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:45.620
Anyone's will do?!

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.660
So you're in love with thosees?!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.960
I'm going to hunt every last one of them!

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.760
It's time to  hunt!!

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:55.800
Shit! Just leave the palanquin

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:56.470
Form a wall!

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:58.840
Don't let them take one step through here!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:04.040
Wh-What the hell?!

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.180
I've realized.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:07.980
Aizen Myouou?

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:12.180
To think that my heart was taken by some woman that I don't even know who is.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:14.490
Now I remember everything.

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:18.560
The one my heart is dedicated to, the one I am in love with...

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:20.460
is only butts.

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:23.800
Ahhnnn~ I'm sorry!

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:26.630
I accidentally saw so
many tasty men's asses.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:27.320
Who the hell?!

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.330
He just awoke on a different path now!

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:33.870
Rather than Aizen Myouou, let's have some fun with us!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.770
They've formed a squad!

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:39.080
The guys that lost their
have formed a squad!

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:42.580
A path has opened!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:44.850
With everyone's help, it has opened!

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:48.390
But these crazy guys are just doing whatever they want!

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:51.020
We give you our thanks, Otae, Kyuubei, Gorilla.

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:54.390
We'll get back all your hearts!

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.260
We will take these guys!

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:59.060
Go, Honey!!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:03.400
Go to that drowsy-eyed woman, Honey, and then slap her away!

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:06.040
I know you can do it, Honey.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:07.570
I believe in you.

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:12.480
Honey, eh?

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:15.550
This might be the last time I get called that.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:22.490
Farewell, Darling.

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:29.830
Emm, Honey...?

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.300
We can't really say "Farewell" like—

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.300
Don't ever you touch me, Beast!!

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.570
Err, but I don't do anything—

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.250
I dunno.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.580
I've never fallen in love with a man.

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:56.590
It's all so difificult, you know, to liking a person.

00:07:57.760 --> 00:08:00.660
Someday you'll understand it...

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:03.500
once you find someone you really like,

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:06.830
Tsukuyo-chan.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.070
Ironic, isn't it?

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:13.270
You, who said back then that you didn't understand what falling in love was...

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:15.770
has now come to block my pathway of love.

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:17.980
Can't you read the situation?

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:19.850
At last we were finally alone together.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:21.980
Why are you standing over there?!

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:26.690
Tsukuyo-chan, did you perhaps find a man you like?

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:28.520
Might it be this man?

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:29.800
That's not a person!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.490
That's a beast that stands on two legs!

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.760
Actually I'm standing on a third leg.

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:35.490
The hell are you talking about?!

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:38.500
But, you had to run while you still can.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:41.800
I have transported all of the remaining Aizen Kou here.

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:45.140
My jumping down from here is the signal.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:47.670
This will be a sea of fire.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.710
But the smell of Aizen Kou and myself burning...

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:53.010
will never leave everyone's mind.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.280
Don't be so hasty.

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:57.250
The only thing a woman should be jumping into is a man's chest.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:00.120
If you want, let's fall together
onto <i>the street of passion.</i>

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:02.520
Would you shut up?!

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:09.860
Tsukuyo-chan, I am a heartless woman who left that person and forgot him.

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:13.970
Even if this body falls, if I am loved by everyone,

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:17.870
if I pour love into everyone and become an immortal,

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:19.400
don't you think it would be beautiful?

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.480
You can't forget it.

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:28.350
You can't forget the feelings you had for him.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:32.550
And to forget it, you do all of this...

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.050
Hey, did you know?

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:39.360
About Hotaru, they say she ignored a great minister.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:40.360
Eeh?!

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:44.300
I heard, she left a man she liked back in her hometown and still believe in him.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:45.060
What an idiot.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:49.070
Like hell that man would remember a woman that gets sold cheap in this place.

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:50.940
She got the higher-ups angry, too.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:54.110
And now, she entertain another customer at some cheap shop

00:09:55.770 --> 00:09:57.910
Umm, Sir?

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.710
Don't you think you've drank too much?

00:10:00.710 --> 00:10:02.910
If you drink that much...

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.220
It's fine.

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:07.590
I'm here just because my parents forced me to.

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:11.190
I just need to stay here and drink until my parents are satisfied.

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:13.890
I-Is that so?

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:15.890
Also...

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:20.670
I'm satisfied just by seeing you sitting there happy.

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:21.370
Huh?

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.600
Your name is Hotaru, right, for now?

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:27.970
Are you perhaps...

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:29.470
No way...

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:32.710
That carpenter apprentice you met,

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:36.250
would talk with you all night without laying a finger on you, right?

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:40.750
He make you having the face of a regular girl.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.650
Hotaru.

00:10:42.650 --> 00:10:45.920
Sorry, but this is the last time I'm coming to see you.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:50.300
If I want to be a full-fledged
carpenter, I've got to train so hard.

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:55.330
But once I'm able to stand on my own,
I'll come back to take you.

00:10:56.900 --> 00:11:02.110
Until then, can you wait here for me?

00:11:02.310 --> 00:11:05.940
If I had done as that man said and waited for him,

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:09.150
maybe I could have stayed in a dream that I never woke up from it.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:14.150
But then, Yoshiwara was released right after Housen was defeated.

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:16.590
My dream...

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:19.790
I tried to grasp it even if it's just illusion.

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:29.800
It was the daughter of the head carpenter.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:33.210
That man had become a great carpenter.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:35.670
One so great that cannot be reach...

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:39.680
by a woman like me.

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:43.350
I knew that from the start, yet I

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:46.180
could not forget that man.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:09.210
But in the end, I'm not able to use the drug on that man.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:14.580
Tsukuyo-chan, falling in love with a person really is hard.

00:12:15.110 --> 00:12:20.520
I've now both forgotten, how to love someone and to be loved by someone.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:23.120
So, even if it's temporary,

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:25.590
at least let me sleep within a dream I'll never wake up...

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:29.360
from among flowers that will never wilt...

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:29.860
Hota—

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:31.680
Sorry.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:36.400
Rotating beds are often found in Love Hotels or something like that.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:36.400
If you're going to sleep in that place, why not sleep in a rotating bed with me first?

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.040
Eh?

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:40.210
What're ya doin, bastard?!

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:42.110
You're trying to seduce her at a time like this?!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:47.010
I thought I'd be able get down with her now, 'cuz luck day is the day you choose to act, and other day is unlucky day.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:48.650
You're really gonna be going down!

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:50.580
365 days a year for you will be unlucky days!!

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.290
And what the heck sorta position you stuck her in?!

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.790
I've got a part sticking out that should be asy to grab onto.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:56.890
I'll throw you in jail, freak!

00:12:56.890 --> 00:13:00.060
Let go! Let go of Hotaru, beast!

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:01.540
If I let go, we'll fall!

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:02.830
If I let go, we'll die!

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:06.460
Our lives are in your hands, Honey, so please hold on, hey!

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:08.280
Let go!

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:10.600
Let go of my hand, you beast!

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:13.410
I'm the one holding on!
Like hell I'll let it go!

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:17.280
Tsukuyo-chan, hurry get out of here!

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:18.510
That's enough!

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:20.580
You don't have to worry about me!

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:23.080
I'm not running, Hotaru.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:27.090
Because now, I can understand...

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:29.420
You same like the others.

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:33.460
Before those flowers, any ways of being loving or loved get totally forgotten.

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:38.760
Women live with a single unwieldy flower like that in their hearts.

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:41.630
There might not be a flower like that that blooms forever.

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:41.630
Fire!!

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:45.270
It might be a flower that fades and wilts pretty easily.

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:48.820
But Hotaru, no matter how many times it wilts,

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:51.980
when the season change, that flower blooms again.

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:54.150
Tsukuyo-chan!!

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:04.590
Hotaru...

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:08.660
I don't think that a flower that's never known wilting is beautiful.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:11.060
Everytime the petals fall, it blooms again.

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:14.030
That's why love is beautiful.

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:17.800
Hotaru, you can still...

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.710
keep blooming plenty.

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:22.810
Fireee!

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.640
Honeeey!!

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:28.180
Darliinnnng!

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:33.690
Enough already.

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:39.060
You just plugging away with your artillery at other people's honeys, you premature beast!

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.970
I won't let the petals...

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.500
of one more flower...

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:46.060
of my honeys fall!

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:50.870
